# Testing Rules


## Testing Philosophy

Every important feature must have tests.

Tests are part of implementation, not optional.


==================================================
BACKEND TESTING
==================================================

Use:

- RSpec
- FactoryBot
- Faker


Test:


Models

- validations
- associations
- scopes


Controllers

- authentication
- authorization
- responses


Interactors

- business workflows
- transactions


Policies

- permissions


Jobs

- execution
- retries


==================================================
FRONTEND TESTING
==================================================

Use:

- Jest
- React Testing Library


Test:

- Components
- Hooks
- Forms
- User interactions


==================================================
END TO END TESTING
==================================================

Use:

Playwright


Critical flows:


Authentication

- Login
- Logout
- Password reset


Admin:

- Create student
- Create teacher


Teacher:

- Add grade
- Mark attendance


Parent:

- View child progress


Student:

- View grades


==================================================
TEST QUALITY
==================================================

Avoid testing implementation details.


Prefer testing:

- User behavior
- Business requirements
- Expected results